      points: ["Most current assets are inventory; cannot pay debts without selling inventory (1)", "Cause: over-buying or slow-moving and obsolete titles (1)", "First action, for example sale of slow inventory or returns to publisher (1)", "Second action, for example smaller and more frequent orders (1)", "Limitation of an action, for example lower margin or lost bulk discount (1)"],
