      points: ["Advantage: cash retained, lower overdraft and interest (1)", "Disadvantage: loss of cash discounts reduces profit (1)", "Disadvantage: supplier goodwill, credit or supply may be withdrawn (1)", "Action: negotiate agreed terms and pay on time (1)", "Judgement supported by reasoning (1)", "Recognises difference between planned credit and inability to pay (1)"],
