          points: ["Profit before interest against interest after the new loan, $30,000 against $6,000 (1)", "Tells the bank interest is affordable with a margin of safety (1)", "ROCE 15.00% compared with the 10% cost of the loan (1)", "Tells the bank the equipment should add to profit if it earns a similar return (1)", "Security in non-current assets and the level of existing borrowing (1)", "Liquidity ratios or cash budget to judge ability to repay $10,000 a year (1)"],
