          points: ["Supplier: deciding on credit, uses acid test (liquid) ratio and bank balance (1)", "Supplier: acid test (liquid) ratio 0.70:1 and bank $1,000 suggest caution (1)", "Mechanics: job security and pay, use profit and ROCE (1)", "Mechanics: profitable but cash is tight after loan repayments (1)"],
